WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Hello everybody. My name is Markiplier and in this video

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
I attempt to teach Jack and Felix how to play World of Warcraft.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.100
But, before I do that.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:08.620
I had to say a short little something.

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:13.920
Because if you didn't know about me, I AM, and have been for a long time...

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.520
A legitimate fan of the Warcraft universe.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.100
I've played World of Warcraft since it first came out

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.420
and I have sunk literally thousands upon thousands

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.080
of hours in-of my life into that game

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.260
Uh, but even before that, I was first introduced to Warcraft

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.520
because my dad bought it for me.

00:00:30.520 --> 00:00:32.280
I can't remember what year it was but...

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.820
For Christmas one year he bought me

00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:39.320
Warcraft 3 and ever since then I was
hooked on the universe

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.900
I loved the Warcraft universe.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.969
There was so much to it. There was so much oozing

00:00:44.969 --> 00:00:47.520
lore out of every pore, it was amazing

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.540
And I, I just ate it all up and

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.560
that's why I got so wrapped up in World of
Warcraft

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.820
And some of my best memories

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.700
from playing any sort of game

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:57.020
come from World of Warcraft

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:59.620
and playing with my friends in my various guilds

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.940
that I played throughout the years,

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:06.020
And just having a good time exploring this BIG, beautiful universe.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.620
SO, the reason I say this is because the
people behind the Warcraft movie,

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:12.860
they came to me and they asked for my help to
help promote the movie

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.680
And I am honestly and truly legitimately excited for this.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:21.540
I don't do these sort of things unless I actually like the thing that I'm promoting.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:25.300
And in this case, I LOVE the thing that I'm promoting!

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:31.540
It's a rare occurrence where I actually get to tell you guys about something that I'm legitimately passionate about

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:32.500
And I am!

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.780
Because I fell in love with the entire universe, an- and the characters in this movie

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.780
a lot of people who have played World of Warcraft might not know them.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.700
I mean there's Khadgar in this movie,

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.480
but this is like early Khadgar and in the most recent expansion you see him when he's much older,

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.729
and much more mature.

00:01:47.729 --> 00:01:50.560
There's like Lothar, which not many people know about

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:52.660
there's Durotan, which people may not know about.

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:55.680
And there's Garona who's mentioned in Wrath of (the) Lich King

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.740
and may have been mentioned at some
other point in the most recent expansion

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:01.520
I didn't explore every single nook and
cranny so

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.600
But these characters, like coming together all doing like...

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.980
th--I can't tell you everything about the story or else I would

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.160
but I can't spoil anything.

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:15.160
But it's just, it's really cool to see all this history, that I've known for years,

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.380
finally come to life in a movie.

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:20.540
And you can say whatever you want about a game vs. a movie

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.440
and whether a game should be a movie in the first place.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:27.640
But what I know is that I love the story behind Warcraft.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.020
And throughout the entirety of my time playing

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:36.460
I've almost never not loved finding out new things about this universe.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:39.460
I say almost 'cause I can't be overly like joyous about it.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:42.100
There's been ups and downs! Especially in the World of Warcraft time.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.830
But honestly and truly,

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.600
I'm excited about this movie, I'm excited
to play this game with my friends and to

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.820
to show them how I love the game

